见世道人情之薄。","notes":null,"partOrder":2,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0002-1:part-3","annotationId":"0002","glossId":"0002-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi/0002-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"总评","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评","excerpt":"比兴流民远兄弟、托父母昆弟而终不得其亲，由此见世道人情之薄。","fullText":"方玉润总评承《集传》“世衰民散，有去其鄉里家族而流離失所之作”之说，认为《葛藟》所写正是离乡失宗之民。其以葛藟本须附木，而今独在河滸、河涘、河漘，无高木可依，比兴流民远兄弟、托父母昆弟而终不得其亲，由此见世道人情之薄。","notes":null,"partOrder":3,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0003-1:part-1","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi/0003-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"眉評","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"眉评","excerpt":"方玉润眉评仅下一语，谓此诗“沉痛語，不忍卒讀”，","fullText":"方玉润眉评仅下一语，谓此诗“沉痛語，不忍卒讀”，直点其哀恸沉痛的情感强度。","notes":null,"partOrder":1,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0003-1:part-2","annotationId":"0003","glossId":"0003-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi/0003-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下)","contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","publicationYear":1986,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"眉評","sourceLabel":null,"attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"眉评","excerpt":"直点其哀恸沉痛的情感强度。","fullText":"方玉润眉评仅下一语，谓此诗“沉痛語，不忍卒讀”，直点其哀恸沉痛的情感强度。","notes":null,"partOrder":2,"anchorIds":[],"glossAnchorIds":[],"segmentIds":[]},{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi:0004-1:part-1","annotationId":"0004","glossId":"0004-1","glossHref":"/shijing/gloss/071-ge-lei/fangyurun-yuanshi/0004-1","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","materialTitle":"诗经原始(上下